{"id": "22-874-2-3", "zh": "以 a 结尾的阳性词：purisa 等词群", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-875-2-5", "zh": "下面阐明阳性词。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-876-2-18", "zh": "阳性词分为七类：以 a 结尾的、以 ā 结尾的、以 i 结尾的、以 ī 结尾的、以 u 结尾的、以 ū 结尾的、以 o 结尾的。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-877-2-19", "zh": "第107条：sisso［ka.104；rū.66；nī.272］。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-878-2-7", "zh": "在阳性中，a 之后的 si 变为 o。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "22-879-2-4", "zh": "例如：puriso tiṭṭhati（人站着）。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "22-880-2-23", "zh": "第108条：ato yonaṃ ṭāṭe［ka.107；rū.69；nī.275，277］。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-881-2-13", "zh": "在阳性和中性中，a 之后的第一格 yo 与第二格 yo 依次变为 ṭā、ṭe。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-881-14-16", "zh": "附加标记 ṭ 表示替换整个词尾。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "22-882-2-4", "zh": "例如：purisā tiṭṭhanti（人们站着）。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "22-883-2-28", "zh": "依“gasīnaṃ”规则，si 脱落：bho purisa；依“ayunaṃ vā dīgho”规则变为长音：bho purisā；bhonto purisā；purisaṃ；purise。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "22-884-2-19", "zh": "第109条：atena［ka.103；rū.79；nī.271］。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-885-2-9", "zh": "在阳性和中性中，a 之后的具格 nā 替换为 ena。", "confidence": 86}
{"id": "22-886-2-3", "zh": "例如：purisena。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "22-887-2-19", "zh": "第110条：suhisvasse［ka.101；rū.80；nī.68］。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-888-2-12", "zh": "在阳性和中性中，在 su、hi 之前，a 变为 e。", "confidence": 86}
{"id": "22-889-2-5", "zh": "例如：purisehi，purisebhi。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "22-890-2-21", "zh": "第111条：suu sassa［ka.61；rū.86；nī.208］。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-891-2-6", "zh": "在 sa 的前面增加 s 音。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "22-891-7-13", "zh": "u 音只为发音而设；附加标记 ñ 用来表明是加在前面。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-892-2-9", "zh": "例如：purisassa；依“sunaṃhisū”规则变为长音。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-892-10-15", "zh": "purisānaṃ，purisasmā，purisamhā。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "22-893-2-19", "zh": "第112条：smāsmiṃnaṃ［ka.108；rū.90；nī.276］。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-894-2-14", "zh": "在阳性和中性中，a 之后的 smā、smiṃ 依次变为 ṭā、ṭe。", "confidence": 86}
{"id": "22-895-2-19", "zh": "例如：purisā，purisehi，purisebhi，purisassa，purisānaṃ，purisasmiṃ，purisamhi，purise，purisesu。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "22-896-2-34", "zh": "buddho、dhammo、saṅgho、sakko、devo、satto、naro、goṇo、puṅgavo、jaraggavo、sagavo、paragavo、rājagavo、mātugāmo、orodho、dāro 等也照此变化。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-897-2-3", "zh": "下面说特殊规定。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-898-2-12", "zh": "第113条：kvace vā［nī.277］。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-899-2-11", "zh": "在阳性和中性中，a 之后的 si 有时可以变为 e。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-900-2-4", "zh": "先说阳性：", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-901-2-33", "zh": "例如：“vanappagumbe yatha phussitagge”（就像林中的树丛枝头开满了花）［khu.pā.6.13；su.ni.236］；“ke gandhabbe rakkhase ca nāge，ke kimpurise cāpi mānuse”（哪些乾闼婆、罗刹和龙，哪些紧那罗以及人）。", "confidence": 72}
{"id": "22-901-34-37", "zh": "“ke paṇḍite sabbakāmadade”（哪位能满足一切愿望的智者）。", "confidence": 68}
{"id": "22-901-38-53", "zh": "“dīgharattaṃ bhattā me bhavissati”（他将长久做我的丈夫）［jā.2.22.1352］。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-901-54-101", "zh": "natthi attakāre natthi parakāre natthi purisakāre（没有自己的作为，没有他人的作为，没有人的作为）［dī.ni.1.168］；eke ekatthe（一个意义相同）；same samabhāge（相等、部分相同）；nahevaṃ vattabbe（不应这样说）［kathā.1］；ke chave siṅgāle（谁是卑贱的豺狼）；ke chave pāthikaputte（谁是卑贱的 Pāthikaputta）［dī.ni.3.29-31］等等。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-902-2-5", "zh": "在中性中则如：", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-903-2-19", "zh": "bhogavatī nāma mandire，nagare nimmite kañcanamaye（名为 Bhogavatī 的宫殿，用黄金造成的城）［jā.2.22.1370］等等。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-904-2-4", "zh": "为什么说“可以”？", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-904-5-6", "zh": "因为也有 vanappagumbo 这样的形式。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-905-2-4", "zh": "为什么说“有时”？", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-905-5-6", "zh": "因为通常是 puriso。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-906-2-7", "zh": "依大规则，第一格 yo 有时也变为 ṭe。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-906-8-53", "zh": "例如：bāle ca paṇḍite ca sandhāvitvā saṃsaritvā dukkhassantaṃ karissanti（愚人和智者流转轮回之后，都将终结痛苦）［dī.ni.1.168］。有时 yo 保持原形不变，例如：vane vāḷamigā ceva，acchakokataracchayo，bahūhi paripanthayo（林中有猛兽，有熊、狼和鬣狗，有许多危险）［jā.2.22.255］；kyassa byapathayo assu 等等。", "confidence": 62}
{"id": "22-907-2-15", "zh": "第114条：divādito［ka.206；rū.165］。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-908-2-6", "zh": "在 diva 等词之后，smiṃ 变为 ṭi。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-909-2-3", "zh": "divi 意思是“在天界”。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-910-2-8", "zh": "“等”字包括 asa、bhuvi，这里一律增加 v 音。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "22-910-9-18", "zh": "依大规则，ayya 一词在呼格中，ga 与 yo 可以变为 ṭo。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-910-19-28", "zh": "例如：bho ayyo 或 ayya；bhonto ayyo 或 ayyā。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "22-910-29-31", "zh": "其余与 purisa 相同。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "22-911-2-4", "zh": "purisa 等词群完。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "22-912-2-2", "zh": "mano 类词群", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-913-2-14", "zh": "mano，manā，bho mana，bho manā，bhonto manā。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "22-914-2-25", "zh": "第115条：manādīhi smiṃsaṃnāsmānaṃ sisoosāsā［ka.181-2，184；rū.95-97；nī.373-4，376-7］。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-915-2-24", "zh": "在这些词之后，smiṃ、sa、aṃ、nā、smā 依次可以变为 si、so、o、sā、sā。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-916-2-50", "zh": "manaṃ，mano，mane，manena，manasā，manehi，manebhi，manassa，manaso，manānaṃ，manasmā，manamhā，manasā，manā，manehi，manebhi，manassa，manaso，manānaṃ，manasmiṃ，manamhi，manasi，mane，manesu。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "22-917-2-37", "zh": "tamo、tapo、tejo、siro、uro、vaco、rajo、ojo、ayo、payo、vayo、saro、yaso、ceto、chando、radhatā、aho 等，属于 mano 类。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-918-2-4", "zh": "mano 类的特征如下：", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-918-5-14", "zh": "作动作的宾语时以 o 结尾；在 nā 等之前带 s；在复合词和派生词中间也以 o 结尾。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-919-2-54", "zh": "例如：yo ve dassanti vatvāna，adāne kurute mano（说了“我会给”，心里却打算不给的人）［jā.1.15.61］；kassapassa vaco sutvā（听了迦叶的话）；tapo idha pakrubbati（在这里修苦行）［saṃ.ni.1.204］；ceto paricca jānāti（以心了知他人的心）［dī.ni.1.242］；siro te bādhayissāmi（我要打碎你的头）等等。", "confidence": 68}
{"id": "22-920-2-37", "zh": "manasā ce pasannena（如果以清净的心）［dha.pa.2］；vippasannena cetasā（以极清净的心）［jā.2.22.551］；vacasā manasā ceva，vandā me te tathāgate（我以语言和心意礼敬那些如来）［parittapāḷi āṭānāṭiyasutta］。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-920-38-126", "zh": "ekūnatiṃso vayasā（二十九岁时）［dī.ni.2.214］；tejasā yasasā jalaṃ（以威光和名声照耀）［vi.va.857］；tapasā uttamo satto（以苦行而至上的众生）；ghatena vā bhuñjassu payasā vā（请配着酥油或牛奶吃）；vandāmi sirasā pāde（我以头礼足）［jā.2.20.68］；ye etā upasevanti，chandasā vā dhanena vā（那些出于爱欲或为了钱财而亲近她们的人）［jā.2.21.350］；urasā panudissāmi（我要用胸膛推开）［jā.2.22.1833］；ayasā paṭikujjhito（被铁覆盖着）［a.ni.3.36］等等。", "confidence": 68}
{"id": "22-921-2-46", "zh": "na mayhaṃ manaso piyo（我的心并不喜爱）［jā.1.10.11］；cetaso parivitakko udapādi（心中生起了这样的思量）［pārā.18］；cetaso samannāhāro（心的专注）；sādhu khalu payaso pānaṃ（喝牛奶真好）；sāvittī chandaso mukhaṃ（娑维底是诗律之首）［ma.ni.2.400］等等。", "confidence": 68}
{"id": "22-922-2-40", "zh": "sādhukaṃ manasi karotha（好好地用心思维）［dī.ni.2.3］；etamatthaṃ cetasi sannidhāya（把这个道理放在心上）；sirasi añjaliṃ katvā（在头顶合掌）［apa.thera 1.41.82］；urasilomo（胸前有毛的人）；pāpaṃ akāsi rahasi（暗中作了恶）等等。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-923-2-53", "zh": "manodhātu（意界）；manomayaṃ（意所成）；tamokhandhaṃ padālayi（破除了黑暗聚）；tapodhano（以苦行为财富的人）；tejodhātu（火界）；siroruhā kesā（长在头上的头发）；saroruhaṃ padumaṃ（生于湖中的莲花）；rajoharaṇaṃ vatthaṃ（拭尘的布）；ojoharaṇā sākhā（夺取精气的枝条）；ayopatto（铁钵）；vayoguṇā anupubbaṃ jahanti（各个年龄阶段依次舍离而去）；yasodharā devī（耶输陀罗夫人）；cetoyuttā dhammā（与心相应的法）；chandovicitipakaraṇaṃ（诗律论）；rahogato cintesi（独处时思量）；ahorattānamaccaye（日夜过去之后）［saṃ.ni.1.112］等等。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-924-2-14", "zh": "依大规则，在 aha 之后，smiṃ 变为 ni 或 u，例如：tadahani，tadahu。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "22-924-15-37", "zh": "在 raha 之后，smiṃ 变为 o，例如：mātugāmena saddhiṃ eko ekāya raho nisīdati（单独与一个女人在隐蔽处坐着）［pārā.452］；raho tiṭṭhati（在隐蔽处站着）；raho manteti（在隐蔽处商议）。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "22-925-2-4", "zh": "mano 类词群完。", "confidence": 88}
